<h1>Quantum Formalism</h1>
<p>A state vector <span class="math math-inline">$|psi rangle$</span> satisfies:</p>
<p><div class="math math-display">$$
i hbar \frac{d}{dt} |\psi\rangle = \hat{H} |\psi\rangle
$$</div>
</p>
<table><thead><tr><th style="text-align: left">Observable</th><th style="text-align: left">Operator</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td style="text-align: left">Momentum</td><td style="text-align: left"><span class="math math-inline">$-i \hbar \nabla$</span></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
